<Layout
  title="Investment Mortgage: A Complete Guide | Cliffco Mortgage Bankers"
  description="How investment property mortgages work, loan types, qualification requirements, down payment rules, and how to choose the right loan for your rental property."
  type="article"
  schema={faq}
>
